OL,3,AGlastonbury fans share stories from the
OL,4,Aqueue as festival tickets sell out
OL,5,Aafter 40 minutes
OL,6,
OL,7,FTicket prices breached the #400 mark
OL,8,Ffor the first time this year. In 1970
OL,9,Fthe festival cost #1 and included a
OL,10,Ffree pint of milk from the farm
OL,12,FIf you didn't manage this time around,
OL,13,Fthere's still a bit of hope - thousands
OL,14,Fof volunteers attend the festival each
OL,15,Fyear with organisations like Oxfam and
OL,16,FGreenpeace
